e", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 163259, "title": {"romaji": "Watashi to Isshoni Tobu", "english": "Fly With Me"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video directed by Shuu Sasaki and Yuhei Kanbe for the song <i>Fly With Me</i> by millennium parade. \n\n<br><br>\n<i>Note: The song featured in this music video also serves as the opening theme of the anime Ghost In The Shell SAC_2045.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Dystopian", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cyborg", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cyberpunk", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Robots", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 163696, "title": {"romaji": "Dongwu Tegong Ju", "english": "Spycies"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": null, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Anthropomorphism", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 166048, "title": {"romaji": "Junky Night Town Orchestra", "english": "Junky Night Town Orchestra"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the song <i>Junky Night Town Orchestra</i> by Surii<br><br>\n\n<i>Note: An additional version feat. Len Kagamine aired on Dec 19, 2019.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 3}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": []}, {"id": 168834, "title": {"romaji": "WOKE", "english": "WOKE"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Right there in that little gap between fantasy and reality, me and you, movies and videos, concrete and abstract, is that nice cozy space.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Music", "Psychological"], "tags": []}, {"id": 168979, "title": {"romaji": "Tekkoujo", "english": "Iron Pulse"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A small family-owned iron factory was closed down. What will remain of it?\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169018, "title": {"romaji": "While You Sleep", "english": "While You Sleep"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "On the night of the blue moonlight, the girl has a magical dream. She meets a mushroom fairy who takes her to their festival.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169023, "title": {"romaji": "Grey Zone", "english": "Grey Zone"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Lumps of clay fall into the grey space. The white clay turns into a man, the black clay into a monster. The two lose their flesh every time they move so they start a battle to stay alive.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Horror"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169024, "title": {"romaji": "Mimizu wo Hirottemita", "english": "So I picked up the worm"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Far away from her hometown, the little fox has begun her life in the big city. The monotonous days make her homesick but she realizes she’s the only one who can help her find the answers.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169025, "title": {"romaji": "Kame Sanpo", "english": "Turtle's Stroll"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "One day, a pet turtle named Kamesuke decided to go out alone. It should have been all that he had hoped for and yet he couldn't help but feel like something was missing.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Anthropomorphism", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Trains", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 169027, "title": {"romaji": "A DOG", "english": "A DOG"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Once upon a time, a man killed the king’s pet dog. He was executed and reincarnated as a canis but with the memory of his past life as a man.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama", "Psychological", "Supernatural"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169028, "title": {"romaji": "Ka Neko Yasu", "english": "Long Live the Cat"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Yasu is a cat over 20 years old. He’s still alive and kicking in the house he was left behind.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169320, "title": {"romaji": "Watashi-tachi no Ie", "english": "Our house / Notre maison"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Alice goes alone. She opens the doors like she let her legs do the leading and she finds various houses by various people. This work expresses the landscape or the figure of love that we’re keen from the bottoms of our hearts, with(using) various images and motifs.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169357, "title": {"romaji": "Watashi wa Motif", "english": "I Am a Motif"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "There are three “Motifs”. The complete differences between them make themselves self-doubt. The melody begins, and the music motif could not resist the impulse to dance, but the others also catching up … Am “I” also a “Motif”? This film uses a Fugue from Bach, tries to unify similar concepts that exist in different forms, including music, visual arts, and narrative.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169359, "title": {"romaji": "Ie no Mae ni Ookina Ki ga Aru", "english": "The Big Tree in Front of the House"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "It should have been an ordinary day, but it was very different from usual. There was a large crowd in front of my grandma’s house. Where did people come from and where are they going? I was peeping at them behind the window, but the big tree obstructed my view.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169360, "title": {"romaji": "Strangers in the Alley", "english": "Strangers in the Alley"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Deep down the alley the black cat has entered is a town where nonhuman beings live in peace. The cat returns to his home to rest when suddenly he hears a strange sound coming from next door.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169382, "title": {"romaji": "Empty Hands", "english": "Empty Hands"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "This movie depicts parallel life stories that occur in Japanese modern society. The fate is determined by a person’s name in a hand-playing song, but the reality is unknown. Are they playing into the hands of someone or living invariably?\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 7, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169761, "title": {"romaji": "Hikari no Hyoushou", "english": "Representation of Light"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "My deceased great-grandmother had been a part of my life as a portrait on the wall. I searched for ways to substantiate her life inside me and decided to photograph and develop pictures of her at two different ages.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169762, "title": {"romaji": "Tara Ko wo Sawattara", "english": "Squishy Fish Eggs"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "When I touched the sack of cod roe for the first time, it felt exactly like my thighs. It was light pink and so soft. Maybe my whole world is made of squishy fish eggs.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 169829, "title": {"romaji": "Nezumi to Prism", "english": "The Mouse and a Prism"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The mouse finds a prism and it reveals to him a magnificent rainbow like he’s never seen before. He tries to show his friends but for some reason it won’t reappear. It seems beauty has a mind of its own.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 174504, "title": {"romaji": "Naze Nani Dendrogram", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A series of short specials where Cheshire, Nemesis and Shu explain the world of VRMMO Infinite Dendrogram.", "startDate": {"year": 2019, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 21, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 174791, "title": {"romaji": "Hotarubi no Migomori", "english": "Boy with Child"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The boy get pregnant. Through pain of morning sickness and variety prejudice, Finally he gave birth.\n<br><br>\nGraduate Work 2020, Tokyo University of the Arts, Graduate School of Film and New Media, Department of Animation.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Geidai Animation)", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 10, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "Graduation Project", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 176863, "title": {"romaji": "Tales of Crestoria Off Shot Movie", "english": "Tales of Crestoria Behind the Scenes"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Kanata, Misella, and Vicious sit around a kotatsu in a Japanese-style room, when Cress, protagonist of Tales of Phantasia, the first game of the series, enters through a time-slip from 1995!", "startDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2020, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2020, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Fan